'urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Hide File'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Hide log'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Hide WordPress version'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'High'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'High Sensitivity'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Hit enter to add'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Hit enter to add a username'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'host setting'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'hour'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'hours'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'How do I get to 100%?'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'How does Wordfence determine this?'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'How does Wordfence get IPs'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'How long is an IP address blocked when it breaks a rule'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'How much memory should Wordfence request when scanning'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'How should we treat Google\'s crawlers'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'How to block a network'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'HTML tags will be stripped prior to output and line breaks will be converted into the appropriate tags.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'HTTP Response Code'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Human'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Humans'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Human/Bot'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If anyone\'s requests exceed'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If a crawler\'s page views exceed'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If a crawler\'s pages not found (404s) exceed'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If a human\'s page views exceed'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If a human\'s pages not found (404s) exceed'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If autorenew is enabled for the current license, the license will renew at the next expiration date. If you would like to turn renewal off or assign the license to another site, log into wordfence.com to change it.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If this is a false positive, you can exclude this parameter from being filtered by the firewall'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If this is your first attempt, please try again.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If this option is disabled, Wordfence can look up countries for visitor IP addresses using a local database, but cannot look up regions or cities'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If user hits the relative URL'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If user who is allowed to access the site views the relative URL'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you are using a web server not listed in the dropdown or if file permissions prevent the installer from completing successfully, you will need to perform the change manually. Click Continue below to create the required file and view manual installation instructions.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you cannot complete the setup process, <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">click here for help<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you cannot complete the uninstall process, <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">click here for help<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you delete the wrong file, it could cause your WordPress website to stop functioning, and you will probably have to restore from a backup.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you don\'t have one, you can purchase one now.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you don\'t recognize this file, please <a href="https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/wordfence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact us on the WordPress support forums<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a> before proceeding.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you have automatic updates enabled (see above), you\'ll get an email when an update occurs.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you have separate WordPress installations with Wordfence installed within a subdirectory of this site, it is recommended that you perform the Firewall installation procedure on those sites before this one.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you know your web server\'s configuration, please select it from the list below.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you need to continue using the legacy 2FA mode, you will need to downgrade to the 8.1.4 version of Wordfence temporarily. This feature will be discontinued around July 1, 2026, and legacy 2FA codes will no longer be required at that time, even when using an old plugin version.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you\'re moving to a new host or a new installation location, you may need to temporarily disable extended protection to avoid any file not found errors. Use this action to remove the configuration changes that enable extended protection mode or you can <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">remove them manually<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you use country blocking to block countries from accessing the entire site, it is important to review the allowed services setting to ensure that search engines and other desired services may continue to see the site regardless of a crawler\'s location. Additionally, ad services like Google Ads may penalize listings when a country is blocked from the entire site.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'If you use external services that may send POST requests without these headers, do not use this option, as they will be blocked.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Include'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Ignored IP addresses for Wordfence Web Application Firewall alerting'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Ignored IPs must be separated by commas or placed on separate lines. These addresses will be ignored from any alerts about increased attacks and can be used to ignore things like standalone website security scanners.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Immediately block the IP of users who try to sign in as these usernames'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Immediately block IPs that access these URLs'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Immediately lock out invalid usernames'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Install'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Install an existing license'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp