'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Show Wordfence Automatic Blocks'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Show the standard Wordfence blocked message'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Sign up for Wordfence Care and we\'ll take care of it. Our security experts will clean your site, resolve the infection, and perform a security audit. Get hands-on support with any security issue including help installing, configuring and optimizing Wordfence.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Signatures updated in real-time'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Since you have High Sensitivity scanning enabled, there is a very high likelihood that your results will include false positives. If you think you have indeed been hacked, our team of security experts can help.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Since you have the beta threat defense feed enabled, there is a high likelihood that your results could include false positives. If you think you have indeed been hacked, our team of security experts can help.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Skipped Paths'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Sorry, but no data for that IP or domain was found.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Source'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Space Remaining'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Spam Check'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Specify a valid IP range'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Specify a valid hostname'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Specify an IP range, Hostname or Browser pattern'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Standard Scan'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Start New Scan'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Start all scans remotely (Try this if your scans aren\'t starting and your site is publicly accessible)'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Start time'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Start Your First Scan'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Status'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Stop Ignoring'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Significant'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Significant Events'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Stop Scan'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Stops Complex Attacks'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Stops Password Guessing Attacks'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Success deleting file'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Success removing option'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Success restoring file'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Success updating option'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Successful'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Successfully deleted admin'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Successfully removed data'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Successfully revoked admin'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Sunday'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Switch to New 2FA'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Thanks for sending your diagnostic page over email'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The <code>auto_prepend_file</code> setting has been successfully removed from <code>.htaccess</code> and <code>.user.ini</code>. Once this change takes effect, Extended Protection Mode will be disabled.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The admin user %s was successfully deleted.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The changes have not yet taken effect. If you are using LiteSpeed or IIS as your web server or CGI/FastCGI interface, you may need to wait a few minutes for the changes to take effect since the configuration files are sometimes cached. You also may need to select a different server configuration in order to complete this step, but wait for a few minutes before trying. You can try refreshing this page.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'These options let you choose which site events to record in the audit log. When enabled and your site is connected to Wordfence Central, these events are automatically sent to Central to prevent any tampering by an attacker. When <strong>Audit Log logging mode</strong> is set to "Significant Events", all events except content changes will be recorded. "All Events" will include content-related events and may be used to monitor for unauthorized post or page changes. "Preview" and "Disabled" modes do not send any events to Central.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'These options let you choose which traffic to log and to ignore certain types of visitors, based on their level of access, usernames, IP address, or browser type. If you run a high-traffic website where it is not feasible to see your visitors in real-time, simply change the <strong>Traffic logging mode</strong> to "Security Only."'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Terms of Use and Privacy Policy'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Test Email Sent'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The current scan looks like it has failed. Its last status update was more than %s ago. You may continue to wait in case it resumes or stop and restart the scan. Some sites may need adjustments to run scans reliably.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The error returned was:'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The file %s was successfully deleted.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The file was successfully hidden from public view.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The file %s was successfully restored.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The Full Path disclosure issue has been fixed'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The \'How does Wordfence get IPs\' option was successfully updated to the recommended value.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The license you were using has been removed from your account. Please reach out to <a href="mailto:billing@wordfence.com">billing@wordfence.com</a> or create a Premium support case at <a href="https://support.wordfence.com/support/tickets" target="_blank">https://support.wordfence.com/support/tickets<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a> for more information. Our staff is happy to help.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The option %s was successfully removed.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The plugin will load as a regular plugin after WordPress has been loaded, and while it can block many malicious requests, some vulnerable plugins or WordPress itself may run vulnerable code before all plugins are loaded.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The previous scan has failed. Some sites may need adjustments to run scans reliably.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The previous scan has terminated because the time limit of %s was reached. This limit can be customized on the options page.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The previous scan has terminated because we detected an update occurring during the scan.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The request has been allowlisted. Please try it again.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The required file has been created. You\'ll need to insert the following code into your <code>php.ini</code> to finish installation:'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The results of your scan may indicate that you could benefit from Wordfence Site Cleaning'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The scan has failed because we received an unexpected response from the Wordfence servers. This may be a temporary error, though some sites may need adjustments to run scans reliably.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The scan has failed because we were unable to contact the Wordfence servers. Some sites may need adjustments to run scans reliably.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The Web Application Firewall is currently in Learning Mode.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The URL/parameters in this table will not be tested by the firewall. They are typically added while the firewall is in Learning Mode or by an admin who identifies a particular action/request is a false positive.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The Wordfence Audit Log is a premium feature that records a history of events on your site to assist in monitoring for unauthorized actions or signs of compromise. Events can include everything from user creation and editing to plugin/theme installation and updates. All data captured for relevant events is saved remotely to Wordfence Central to prevent any tampering that may interfere with post-incident analysis and response.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The Wordfence Dashboard provides valuable insights into the current state of your site\'s security. You\'ll find useful data summarized here as well as important status updates and notifications.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The Wordfence Web Application Firewall is a PHP-based, application-level firewall that filters out malicious requests to your site. It is designed to run at the beginning of WordPress\' initialization to filter any attacks before plugins or themes can run any potentially vulnerable code.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'The Wordfence firewall protects your sites from attackers'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Theme Name'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Theme URL'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Themes & Plugins'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'then'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'then redirect that user to'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'then set a cookie that will bypass country blocking in the future in case that user hits the site from a blocked country.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'These URL patterns will be excluded from the throttling rules used to limit crawlers.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'These IPs (or CIDR ranges) will be ignored when determining the requesting IP via the X-Forwarded-For HTTP header. Enter one IP or CIDR range per line.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'There was an error while downgrading to a free license.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'There was an error while sending the email.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This feature blocks all traffic from IPs with a high volume of recent malicious activity using Wordfence\'s real-time blocklist.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This is the severity of the vulnerability itself, which can differ from the scan result severity. Some lower-severity vulnerabilities may still be important to address depending on your site\'s configuration and user base, so they are still important for you to review.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This is where future security alerts for your website will be sent. This can also be changed in Global Options.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This is your Dashboard'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This is your main configuration file and cannot be deleted. It must be cleaned manually.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This is where you can monitor the work Wordfence is doing to protect your site and also where you can manage the options to optimize the firewall\'s configuration.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This key may already be used on several sites. To avoid scan scheduling issues and other problems, you should get a new key or remove it from the other sites.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This PHP setting is currently in use, and is including this file:'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This option enables all "Brute Force Protection" options, including strong password enforcement and invalid login throttling. You can modify individual options below.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This option requires cURL. (This may have no effect on some old PHP or cURL versions.)'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This page shows information that can be used for troubleshooting conflicts, configuration issues, or compatibility with other plugins, themes, or a host\'s environment. Failing tests are not always a sign of something that you need to fix, but can help the Wordfence team when troubleshooting a problem.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This was a premium license key, but it is no longer valid, so premium features are disabled. You can either remove the invalid key and continue using Wordfence\'s free features, or enter a new premium key to upgrade. If you have questions, contact <a href="mailto:billing@wordfence.com">billing@wordfence.com</a>.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'This will be shown only once. Keep these codes somewhere safe.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'throttle it'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Throttled'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Thursday'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Ticket Number/Forum Username'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Tuesday'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Time'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Time Limit'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Time limit that a scan can run in seconds'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Title'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'To'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Toggle row %d'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'To make your site as secure as possible, the Wordfence Web Application Firewall is designed to run via a PHP setting called <code>auto_prepend_file</code>, which ensures it runs before any potentially vulnerable code runs.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Top IPs Blocked'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Traffic logging mode'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Traffic logging mode: All traffic'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Traffic logging mode: Security-related traffic only'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Treat Google like any other Crawler'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Trusted Proxy Preset'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Trusted Proxies'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Turn On'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Twice Daily'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Two Factor Status'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Two-factor authentication now has its own IP allowlist. If necessary, you can allow specific IP addresses or ranges to skip 2FA when logging in.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Type'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Type: %s'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Update Check Error'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Update Block'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Update Payment Method'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unable to automatically hide file'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unable to Uninstall'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unable to Install'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unblock'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unblock IP'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unblock range'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unblocking'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Uninstall Wordfence Firewall'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Uninstallation from this site was successful! The Wordfence Firewall is still active because it is installed in another WordPress installation.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Uninstallation was successful!'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unknown Administrator'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unknown Core File'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unlimited'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unspecified'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Unblock All'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'U.S. Blocked'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Update includes security-related fixes.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Updates Needed (Plugin, Theme, or Core)'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Update interval in seconds'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Update Wordfence automatically when a new version is released?'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Upgrade'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Upgrade to Premium'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'URL to redirect blocked users to'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'URLs Checked'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use low resource scanning (reduces server load by lengthening the scan duration)'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use New 2FA'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use one of these %s codes to log in if you are unable to access your phone. Codes are 16 characters long, plus optional spaces. Each one may be used only once.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use one of these %s codes to log in if you lose access to your authenticator device. Codes are 16 characters long, plus optional spaces. Each one may be used only once.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use only IPv4 to start scans'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use PHP\'s built in REMOTE_ADDR and don\'t use anything else. Very secure if this is compatible with your site.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use preferred start time'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use Recommended Value'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use the Cloudflare "CF-Connecting-IP" HTTP header to get a visitor IP. Only use if you\'re using Cloudflare.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use the X-Forwarded-For HTTP header. Only use if you have a front-end proxy or spoofing may result.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Use the X-Real-IP HTTP header. Only use if you have a front-end proxy or spoofing may result.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'User'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'User Agent'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'User Email'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'User ID'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'User & Option Audit'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Username'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Users Checked'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Very strict. May cause false positives.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Verified Google crawlers will not be rate-limited'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'View'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'View Additional Detail'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'View Differences'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'View File'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'View Customization'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'View full log'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'View log'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'View Option'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'View Updates'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Visit Wordfence Central'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Vulnerability Information'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Vulnerability Scan'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Vulnerability Severity'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'WAF Status'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'WAF Currently in Learning Mode'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Warning'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'WARNING'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Waiting for Changes'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Waiting for it to take effect. This may take up to %s.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wednesday'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Weekdays'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Weekends'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'When you first install the Wordfence Web Application Firewall, it will be in learning mode. This allows Wordfence to learn about your site so that we can understand how to protect it and how to allow normal visitors through the firewall. We recommend you let Wordfence learn for a week before you enable the firewall.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'What to do when we block someone'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'What to Block'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We are about to change your <em>.htaccess</em> file. Please make a backup of this file before proceeding.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We are excited to announce the release of a completely rebuilt two-factor authentication (2FA) feature within Wordfence. 2FA is an important layer of security that protects you from password guessing and credential stuffing attacks. Previously a Premium-only feature, it is now available for sites running the free version of Wordfence. You are now able to enable 2FA for any role, we’ve added a number of important security features, and we’ve significantly improved the admin interface.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We can\'t modify your .htaccess file for you because: %s'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We encountered a problem'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We encountered an error trying load more data.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We failed to send a termination request.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We have updated our policies. To continue using Wordfence, you will need to read and agree to the Wordfence License Terms and Conditions, the Services Subscription Agreement, and Terms of Service, and read and acknowledge the Wordfence Privacy Policy by clicking Review.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We have updated our policies. To continue using Wordfence, you will need to read and agree to the <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wordfence License Terms and Conditions<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>, the <a href="%2$s" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Services Subscription Agreement<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>, and <a href="%3$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms of Service<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>, and read and acknowledge the <a href="%4$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wordfence Privacy Policy<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We\'ve preselected your server configuration based on our tests, but if you know your web server\'s configuration, please select it now.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We\'ve preselected your server configuration based on our tests, but if you know your web server\'s configuration, please select it now. You can also choose "Manual Configuration" for alternate installation details.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We successfully exported your site options. To import your site options on another site, copy and paste the token below into the import text box on the destination site. Keep this token secret – it is like a password. If anyone else discovers the token it will allow them to import your options excluding your license.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'We successfully imported the site options.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Web Application Firewall (WAF)'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Web Application Firewall'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Web Application Firewall Status'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Where to email alerts'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Whois Lookup'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Assistant'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Assistant Present'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence automatically allowlists <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">private networks<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a> because these are not routable on the public Internet.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Central allows you to manage Wordfence on multiple sites from one location. It makes security monitoring and configuring Wordfence easier.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Central Status'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence country blocking is designed to stop an attack, prevent content theft, or end malicious activity that originates from a geographic region in less than 1/300,000th of a second. Blocking countries who are regularly creating failed logins, a large number of page not found errors, and are clearly engaged in malicious activity is an effective way to protect your site during an attack.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Firewall & Care License Enabled'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Firewall & Premium Enabled'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Firewall & Response License Enabled'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Firewall Activated'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Firewall Deactivated'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Firewall blocked a background request to WordPress for the URL %s. If this occurred as a result of an intentional action, you may consider allowlisting the request to allow it in the future.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Global Options'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence is working...'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence lets you take control of protecting your site with powerful blocking features. Block traffic based on IP, IP range, hostname, browser, or referrer. Country blocking is available for Premium customers.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence License'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Live Traffic shows you what is happening on your site in real-time, including user logins, hack attempts, and requests that were blocked by the Wordfence Firewall. You can choose to log security-related traffic only or all traffic. Traffic is logged directly on the server, which means it includes visits that don\'t execute JavaScript. Google and other JavaScript-based analytics packages typically only show visits from browsers that are operated by a human, while Live Traffic can show visits from crawlers like Google and Bing.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Protection Activated'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence protects your site from password-guessing attacks by locking out attackers and helping you avoid weak passwords.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Scan & Care License Enabled'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Scan & Premium Enabled'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Scan & Response License Enabled'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Scan Deactivated'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence Scan Enabled'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence will make one attempt to resume each failed scan stage. This scan may recover if this attempt is successful.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence will make up to %d attempts to resume each failed scan stage. This scan may recover if one of these attempts is successful.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Wordfence\'s terms of service and privacy policy have changed'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'WordPress Configuration File'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Would you like WordPress security and vulnerability alerts sent to you via email?'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Yes'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Yes Please'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You can <a class="wf-onboarding-link" href="%s" target="_blank">get a new free license<span class="screen-reader-text">(opens in new tab)</span></a> for this site directly, or click the "Get a free license" button at the top of the Licenses page when logged in to wordfence.com if you need more than one.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You have successfully installed a free license.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You must select either "Yes" or "No"'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You will be reminded again in 12 hours.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Your IP with this setting'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You are currently running the WAF from another WordPress installation. This option can be changed once you configure the firewall to run correctly on this site.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You are currently running the WAF from another WordPress installation. These rules can be disabled or enabled once you configure the firewall to run correctly on this site.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You are currently running the Wordfence Web Application Firewall from another WordPress installation.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You\'ve optimized configurations for this feature! If you want to learn more about how this score is determined, click the link below.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You are currently running the Wordfence Web Application Firewall from another WordPress installation. Please configure the firewall to run correctly on this site.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You are currently running the Wordfence Web Application Firewall from another WordPress installation. Please <a href="%s">click here</a> to configure the Firewall to run correctly on this site.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You are running the LiteSpeed web server and Wordfence can\'t determine whether "noabort" is set. Please verify that the environmental variable "noabort" is set for the local site, or the server\'s global External Application Abort is set to "No Abort".'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You are using Nginx as your web server. You\'ll need to disable autoindexing in your nginx.conf. See the <a target=\'_blank\'  rel=\'noopener noreferrer\' href=\'https://nginx.org/en/docs/http/ngx_http_autoindex_module.html\'>Nginx docs for more info</a> on how to do this.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You are using an Nginx web server and using a FastCGI processor like PHP5-FPM. You will need to manually delete or hide those files.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You are using an Nginx web server and using a FastCGI processor like PHP5-FPM. You will need to manually modify your php.ini to disable <em>display_error</em>'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You can find more details on alternative setup steps, including installation on SiteGround or for multiple sites sharing a single php.ini, <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">in our documentation<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You can log in to <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wordfence.com<span class="screen-reader-text"> (opens in new tab)</span></a> to accept the updated terms and privacy policy for all of your license keys at once.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You can proceed with the installation and we will include this from within our <code>wordfence-waf.php</code> file which should maintain compatibility with your site, or you can opt to override the existing PHP setting.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You forgot to include a reason you\'re blocking this IP range. We ask you to include this for your own record keeping.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You have unsaved changes to your options. If you leave this page, those changes will be lost.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You may close this alert and try again later, or click the button below to register for a new free Wordfence license.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'You\'ll find this icon throughout the plugin. Clicking it will show you the options and features for each section of Wordfence. From the dashboard, you can find the Global Options for Wordfence such as alerts, automatic updates, and managing your site\'s Premium License.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Your .htaccess has been updated successfully. Please verify your site is functioning normally.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Your Wordfence activity log was sent to %s'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Your Wordfence License'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Your rules have been updated successfully.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Your rules have been updated successfully. You are currently using the free version of Wordfence. Upgrade to Wordfence premium to have your rules updated automatically as new threats emerge. <a href="https://www.wordfence.com/wafUpdateRules1/wordfence-signup/">Click here to purchase a premium license</a>. <em>Note: Your rules will still update every 30 days as a free user.</em>'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Your test email was sent to the requested email address. The result we received from the WordPress wp_mail() function was:'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'blocked by firewall'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'blocked by firewall for %s'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'blocked by real-time IP blocklist'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'blocked by the Wordfence Security Network'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'blocked for %s'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'locked out from logging in'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'Login Security: Enable 2FA for these roles'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Login Security: Allow remembering device for 30 days'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Login Security: Require 2FA for XML-RPC call authentication'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Login Security: Disable XML-RPC authentication'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Login Security: Allowlisted IP addresses that bypass 2FA and reCAPTCHA'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Login Security: Enable reCAPTCHA on the login and user registration pages'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Login Security Options'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Login Security options are available on the Login Security options page'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'United Arab Emirates'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Afghanistan'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Antigua and Barbuda'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Anguilla'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Antarctica'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'American Samoa'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Aland Islands'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Azerbaijan'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Bosnia and Herzegovina'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Bangladesh'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Belgium'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Bahrain'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Benin'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Saint Bartelemey'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Bonaire, Saint Eustatius and Saba'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Brazil'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Bhutan'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Bouvet Island'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Botswana'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Belarus'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Belize'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Canada'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Cocos (Keeling) Islands'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wordfence',1]],'Congo, The Democratic Republic of the'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>